sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client / LangChain / Agent
    participant KC as Keycloak / Kogwistar Token Issuer
    participant G as ModelKeyGuard Gateway
    participant KG as Kogwistar Graph
    participant S as Encrypted Secret Payload
    participant P as Model Provider

    C->>KC: Authenticate / request model token
    KC-->>C: Short-lived token / kgw token

    C->>G: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>Authorization: Bearer kgw_token

    G->>KG: Resolve token node
    KG-->>G: principal, namespace, scopes, quota policy

    G->>KG: Check ACL + namespace + quota
    KG-->>G: allow / block / approval_required

    alt blocked
        G-->>C: 403 blocked
        G->>KG: Append MODEL_CALL_BLOCKED event
    else approval required
        G-->>C: 202 approval required
        G->>KG: Append MODEL_CALL_APPROVAL_REQUIRED event
    else allowed
        G->>S: Load encrypted provider key payload
        S-->>G: ciphertext
        G->>G: Decrypt with MODELKEYGUARD_GRAPH_KEY
        G->>P: Forward request with real provider key
        P-->>G: Model response
        G->>KG: Append MODEL_CALL_COMPLETED event
        G-->>C: OpenAI-compatible response
    end